{"title": "尾斜杠错位实测：粘连与双斜杠", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location /images/ { alias /data/uploads; }  # 少了尾斜杠"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/images/logo.png | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "open() \"/data/uploadslogo.png\" failed (2: No such file or directory)"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "logo.png 被直接粘在 alias 值后，分隔符丢失"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "location /images { alias /data/uploads/; }  # 反向错位"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/images/logo.png"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "UPLOAD"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "拼出 //logo.png 被文件系统容忍：能跑不等于对"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
